=== official sources checklist (checked Asia/Shanghai 2026-11-04) ===
NOT LEGAL ADVICE — rules change; re-read the current official text before acting.
[OK] csrc_2024_8: 证券市场程序化交易管理规定（试行）
    https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2024/issue_11426/202406/content_6959680.html
    verified: Effective 2024-10-08; programmatic trading = computer-generated/routed orders; report-before-trade; exchange sets abnormal thresholds; HFT features delegated to exchanges.
[OK] csrc_2025_12_futures: 期货市场程序化交易管理规定（试行）
    https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2025/issue_12226/202508/content_7036966.html
    verified: Published 2025-06-13; effective 2025-10-09. Futures programmatic trading: report-before-trade (customer→FC→exchange confirm); HFT standards set by futures exchanges; host-colocation/seat rules; abnormal cancel/replace monitoring. Companion official page: https://www.csrc.gov.cn/csrc/c100028/c7564353/content.shtml
[OK] sse_faq_2025_04_03: 上交所就正式发布程序化交易管理实施细则答记者问
    https://www.sse.com.cn/aboutus/mediacenter/hotandd/c/c_20250403_10776805.shtml
    verified: 细则自2025-07-07施行; 高频认定: 单账户每秒申报撤单合计最高≥300笔, 或全日≥20000笔; 四类异常行为构成要件说明.
[OK] szse_细则_pdf: 深圳证券交易所程序化交易管理实施细则
    https://docs.static.szse.cn/www/lawrules/rule/trade/current/W020250403603802169453.pdf
    verified: 自2025-07-07施行; 第33条高频: 每秒≥300笔或单日≥20000笔; 第18条四类异常监控类型.
[OK] szse_release_notice: 关于发布《深圳证券交易所程序化交易管理实施细则》的通知
    https://www.szse.cn/lawrules/rule/trade/current/t20250403_612770.html
    verified: 发布日2025-04-03; 施行2025-07-07.
[OK] sec_15c3_5: 17 CFR 240.15c3-5 Market Access Rule
    https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-17/chapter-II/part-240/subject-group-ECFRc8401dcba174f73/section-240.15c3-5
    verified: Pre-trade credit/capital & erroneous-order controls; regulatory controls; exclusive BD control; ≥annual review + CEO cert.
[OK] reg_sho_201: 17 CFR 242.201 Regulation SHO circuit breaker
    https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-17/chapter-II/part-242/subject-group-ECFR1607681c7b4f78d/section-242.201
    verified: 10% decline from prior-day listing-market close → short sale ≤ NBB restricted for rest of day + next day.
[OK] finra_4210: FINRA Rule 4210 Margin Requirements
    https://www.finra.org/rules-guidance/rulebooks/finra-rules/4210
    verified: Current rule text includes IML / intraday margin deficit definitions (a)(17)-(19) and (d)(2).
[OK] finra_26_10: Regulatory Notice 26-10 (intraday margin replaces PDT)
    https://www.finra.org/rules-guidance/notices/26-10
    verified: Published 2026-04-20; effective 2026-06-04; phase-in to 2027-10-20; replaces pattern day trader count + $25,000 minimum equity with intraday margin standards.
[OK] finra_26_11: Regulatory Notice 26-11 (IMD/IML interpretations for intraday margin)
    https://www.finra.org/rules-guidance/notices/26-11
    verified: Published 2026-05-19; effective 2026-06-04. Publishes Rule 4210 interpretations for new intraday margin: IML (intraday margin level) and IMD (intraday margin deficit = abs of largest negative IML). Deletes obsolete PDT day-trading interpretations. PDF: https://www.finra.org/sites/default/files/2026-05/Regulatory-Notice-26-11.pdf
[OK] finra_15_09: Regulatory Notice 15-09 Algorithmic trading supervision
    https://www.finra.org/rules-guidance/notices/15-09
    verified: Published 2015-03-26; five practice areas; references SEA 15c3-5 and Reg SHO.
